<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: "20px 72px", background: "#F5E3BE", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 122, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>迭代五：Word 交付文档</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 10 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.62)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginTop: 8 }}>第五轮把工程事实翻译成四套面向不同读者的叙述</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 510, flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: "100%", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>代码之外，按不同受众写了四份 Word 文档：面向用户的产品说明、面向开发者的算法实现、面向本科生的算法讲义、面向课程的课程设计报告。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>四份文档共用同一份工程事实，但口径完全不同：产品说明讲怎么用，算法实现讲怎么写的，讲义讲怎么讲明白，报告讲怎么对齐课程要求。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>同一份工程，给评审、给同学、给老师各有一份合适的材料——这是「可交付」的最后一环，也是把个人项目变成「别人能看懂、能复现、能验收」的成品的关键一步。</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", background: "rgba(42,33,24,0.94)", borderLeft: "5px solid #B3271E", borderRadius: 6, padding: "10px 20px", marginTop: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(245,227,190,0.92)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>判断：文档不是附属品——它决定了别人能不能独立复现你的成果。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 48, flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "space-between" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.55)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>弈趣棋苑 · 项目开发汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.55)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>34 / 64</Text>
